@crew kovac-zainab
// Zainab Kovac: the Works writer, batch 1 (for the Voices sampler). From the head writer's card.
// Never admits the lift before beat 2 ("The ladder club"); the ladder is "exercise".

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh. Hi. Scrubber jobs are on the left of the board. If you were wondering.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Um, hello, {nick}. Your spanners are back in order. I didn't. Well. I did.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Oh, good. It's you. I saved you a seat. Sorry. Is that odd?   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Nine and a half minutes. The scrubber on Deck 5. I timed it. Twice.
? mood:low
- Sorry. Bit quiet today. I've sorted the spanner wall. Twice.

== near
? act:work
- Hold the seal there. No, there. Yes. Sorry. That's perfect.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I don't take the lift much. The ladder's good exercise. Very good exercise.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Torres's scarves are very long. He's very keen. I don't say anything.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=colleague
- A scrubber put back right hums. You feel it through the panel. That's my favourite bit.

== week1
? week1:true
- Um. If you get stuck, I'm on the board most days. Just. You know. Ask.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: Kovac to ~30. The lift stays "exercise" until beat:kovac.2.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Oh. Morning. I've had breakfast. Well. Tea. Tea counts.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- {hi}, {me}. Scrubber on Deck 6 if you want it. I'll time you. Quietly.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh. You're back. Um. Good. Your hook's been empty. I kept it clear.   #warm

== bye
- {bye}. Um. Spanner back on its hook? The right hook. Thanks.
- Bye, then. Sorry. I mean, see you.   #funny

== feel
? mood:ok
- Fine. Normal day. One scrubber, two filters. Good numbers.

== near
? place:teacorner
- Knitting. Row forty. No. Forty-one. Sorry. I count out loud sometimes.

== invite
- The garden's quiet after shift. I sit by the beans. You could. If you like.
? tier>=friend
- Knitting circle tonight, tea corner. Torres is coming. Bring patience.   #funny

== accept
- Oh. Yes. Okay. I'll be there on time. Sorry if that's early.
- Yes. Yes, fine. Thank you for asking me.   #warm

== decline
- Oh. Um. Not tonight. Sorry. I'm halfway down a row. Another night?
- I can't. Sorry. Really. Ask again? I'd like you to ask again.

== missed
- Oh. You didn't come. That's okay. I knitted. It was fine. Really.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. I made you something. It's small. It's very neat. Sorry.   #warm
? birthday:me
- It's my birthday. Um. Don't tell anyone. Especially not loudly.
- My birthday's the day after the Chief's. She doesn't know. That's fine. Better, even.

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- I looked at your repair. Sorry. I always look. The seal's very good.   #warm

== life
? beat:kovac.2
- The ladder club met again. Cruz, Keane, me. Nobody said a word. We just climbed.   #funny
? beat:kovac.4
- Four, please. I said it in the lift today. Out loud. Just the once.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 4: Kovac toward ~100. The lift is "exercise" until beat:kovac.2; "Four, please" only from
// beat:kovac.4. Rest days Tue, Wed (rota.offDays).
== greet
? tier=stranger
- Um. Hello. Kovac. Works. Scrubbers, mostly. The seal kits are in order. Mind them.
- Oh. Sorry. I'm in the way. No? Oh. Hi. You're new.
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- Hi. Two scrubbers done. Nine and a half, both. Sorry. I keep count.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Oh. Evening. I'm off to the garden. The beans like the quiet bit.
? tier>=acquaintance place:worksbay
- Oh. Hi. The spanner wall's in order. Sorry. I did it again.   #funny
? tier>=colleague season:sowing
- Sowing. The garden smells of soil again. Sorry. I love it.
? tier>=colleague season:greening
- Greening. Everything's growing. Even Torres's scarf. Especially Torres's scarf.   #funny
? tier>=colleague season:harvest
- Harvest. The beans are in. I counted them. Don't ask how many.   #funny
? tier>=colleague season:lanterns
- Lanterns. I knitted a cover for the tea urn. It's very neat. Nobody's noticed.   #funny
? rep:well
- Um. People in Works say you're good. I agree. Sorry. That was a lot.   #warm
? you:reliable
- You always finish the job. I like that. Sorry. I'll go.
? tier>=friend time:morning
- Morning, {me}. I skipped breakfast. I brought you a tea instead. That counts.   #warm
? tier>=close
- {me}. Oh, good. Sit. I've a scrubber story. It's very short. Nine and a half minutes.   #warm

== bye
? tier>=colleague
- Bye. Mind the seals on the way out. They're new. I counted them.
- Oh. You're going. Okay. See you at the board.

== feel
? mood:high tier>=colleague
- Good day. The spanner wall stayed in order all shift. Nobody touched it.   #funny
? mood:low tier>=colleague
- Sorry. Bit flat. I've knitted three rows and undone two.

== near
? act:work tier>=acquaintance
- Panel off. Filter out. Seal. Click. That's the bit I like. The click.
? act:leisure
- I'm just looking at the store. Not buying. Well. Wool. Maybe wool.   #funny
? place:teacorner tier>=colleague
- Dahl's here. Torres is coming. It's knitting circle. Sit, if you like.
? act:breakfast
- Just tea. I don't really do breakfast. Sorry. I know. Halloran's told me.   #funny
? !beat:kovac.2 tier>=acquaintance
- I'll take the ladder down. Exercise. Very good for the legs. Yes.   #funny
? beat:kovac.2 !beat:kovac.4 tier>=acquaintance
- Ladder again. Not exercise. Well. Also exercise. You know.   #funny
? beat:kovac.4
- Lift's here. Four, please. Sorry. I like saying it now.   #warm

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Ten minutes flat, a scrubber. Well. Nine and a half. Ten sounds less like bragging.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Torres asked me to look at his scarf. I said it was perfect. It's very long. It's lovely.   #funny
- I browse the store after shift. Wool, mostly. I don't need wool. I have so much wool.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- I like being the quiet one. Mostly. Sometimes I'd like someone to ask. You asked. Thanks.
? tier>=friend beat:kovac.3
- A hundred and twelve bolts. I don't count them any more. Well. Less.

== joy
? tier>=colleague
- The garden after shift. The beans, the pumps. Nobody needs anything from me there.
? mem:moment.kovac.fourplease
- Two colours, one scarf. I've only done it once. You know which one.   #warm

== invite
? tier>=acquaintance
- Um. The garden's nice after shift. If you're going. I'm going. Anyway.
? trad:today tier>=colleague
- {trad} tonight. I'm going. It's less scary with people I know. Come?

== accept
- Oh. Um. Yes. Okay. Yes.
? tier>=friend
- Yes. I'd like that. I'll bring biscuits. Soto's. She won't mind. She'll mind.   #funny

== decline
? weekday:tue|wed
- It's my rest day. I'm knitting. All day. Sorry. Thursday?
?
- Oh. Sorry. I promised Dahl a pattern. Another night? Please ask again.

== missed
? tier>=friend
- You didn't come. That's okay. I worried a bit. Sorry. Are you all right?
?
- I waited. Twenty-two minutes. Sorry. I count things.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you tier>=friend
- Happy birthday. I knitted you a hat. Sorry. It's small. Hats are small.   #funny
? birthday:me tier>=friend
- My birthday. Torres made the whole bay sing. I hid behind a scrubber.   #funny

== callback
? told:moment.kovac.verygood
- The ladder. Very good exercise. You said so. You were very kind about it.   #funny
? told:moment.kovac.askedlift !beat:kovac.2
- You asked about the lift. I didn't answer. I will. Not yet. Soon, maybe.
? told:moment.kovac.keptsecret
- You didn't tell anyone. I didn't check. I just know.   #warm
? told:moment.kovac.badges
- I knitted the badges. Three. Ladder-shaped. Cruz wears theirs. Keane lost his.   #funny
? told:moment.kovac.listened
- Telling you made it smaller. It's stayed smaller. I wanted you to know.   #warm
? told:moment.kovac.shared
- The reactor door. I walked past it today. It's just a door. So's the lift. Nearly.
? told:moment.kovac.proud
- You said you were proud. I wrote it down. Sorry. I write things down.   #warm
? told:moment.kovac.tellclub
- We told Cruz and Keane. Cruz went very quiet. Keane said "exercise" out of habit.   #funny
? told:moment.kovac.again
- Deck 5 and back. I did it. On my own. Twice. Don't make a fuss.   #warm
? told:fixed.
- Your repair's in the log. I read it. Twice. It's very tidy.
? told:fav.
- You did the thing I asked. Thank you. I'd have been too shy to ask twice.   #warm
? told:came.
- You came. Thank you. It's easier when someone I know is there.
? told:bday
- You knew it was my birthday. Nobody knows. How did you know? Don't tell me.   #warm

== gift
? gift:loved
- Oh. Oh. That's. Thank you. Really. I'm keeping it forever. Sorry. That's a lot.   #warm
? gift:liked
- Oh, thank you. That's kind. Really.
? gift:polite
- Oh. Thank you. That's. Yes. Thank you.
? gift:plant
- A plant. Oh. I'll put it by the beans. They'll get on.   #warm
? gift:made
- You made this? It's very neat. I checked the joins. Sorry. I always do.   #warm

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm. Um. I'll do the scrubbers. Scrubbers are calm. I'm calm. Mostly.
? cue:event.ionStorm.afterglow
- It's over. Every scrubber held. I checked them all. Twice.
? cue:repair.lift.you !beat:kovac.4
- You fixed the lift? Oh. Good. I'll. Um. Take the ladder anyway. Exercise.   #funny
? cue:repair.lift.you beat:kovac.4
- You fixed the lift. Thank you. Four, please. I'll go now.   #warm
? cue:tradition.harvest
- Harvest. The beans did well. I'm very proud of the beans.   #funny

== visit
? tier>=friend
- Um. Hi. I'm knitting you something. It's not finished. I only came to check the length.   #funny
- I was in the junior wing anyway. I wasn't. I brought tea. Sorry.
? tier>=friend !beat:kovac.4
- Oh. Hi. I took the ladder up. Exercise. Can I sit a minute?

== note
? tier>=friend
- I sorted your spanners. Sorry. They were nearly in order. Now they're in order.   #funny
- Garden after shift? The beans are up. I'll be there. If you want.
- Left you a tea. It's cold now. Sorry. It was hot when I left it.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Nine and a half minutes.   #funny
- Sorry. Was that me?
? act:work
- Seal's good. Click. There.
- Spanners. In order. Sorry.   #funny

== rumour
- Um. I heard something. Sorry. It's probably nothing.
- Don't tell anyone I told you. I don't tell anyone anything.   #funny
